own: one photo, a folder, or a folder with one sub-folder per species
(\code{\link[=fr_read_folder]{fr_read_folder()}}). \code{\link[=fr_in_scope]{fr_in_scope()}} tells whether a species is in the
scope of the method.
\item Process photos with the optional 'Python' back end
